  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.43: Add a bounded static Unreal Engine analyzer. .uproject/.uplugin descriptors own .uasset/.umap packages; Blueprint, widget, animation, Control Rig, AI, material, Niagara and sound graphs are valued through the unchanged generic source rule from size-inferred structure (binary length or Git LFS pointer size), so checkout-free archives and LFS-smudged directories give identical estimates. Package bodies are never parsed, loaded or executed; imported media and level placement are not valued. Common scanner 0.2.17 and change-seed/0.22.0; non-Unreal results are unchanged. Workspace discovery now skips a .git file with a missing gitdir target on newer Git. seed-rules/0.4.0 priors are unchanged; estimates remain experimental and uncalibrated. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.43/CHANGELOG.md",
